---
// spec: S23 /jobs/fpsc (F18-AC3, A-12 reserved slug). Matn aam rehnumai hai (owner ka faisla 13b-3a); owner tasdeeq kare.
import OrgJobsPage from '../../components/OrgJobsPage.astro';

export const prerender = false;

const faq = [
  { q: 'Kya GVS Academy FPSC se juri hai?', a: 'Nahin. GVS niji academy hai. Hum sirf online apply mein madad karte hain. Test aur faisla FPSC ka hota hai.' },
  { q: 'FPSC ki jobs mein kaun apply kar sakta hai?', a: 'Har ishtihar mein taleem, umar aur zone ya domicile ki shartein likhi hoti hain. Apply se pehle woh zaroor parhein.' },
  { q: 'Kya CSS bhi FPSC karwata hai?', a: 'Haan, CSS ka imtihan bhi FPSC leta hai, lekin us ka tareeqa alag hai. Is page par aam bharti ki jobs ki baat hai.' },
  { q: 'Fee kitni hai?', a: 'Sarkari fee har post ke ishtihar mein likhi hoti hai aur official challan par jati hai. Hamari service fee alag hai.' },
];
---
<OrgJobsPage path="/jobs/fpsc" org="FPSC" fullName="Federal Public Service Commission" officialUrl="https://www.fpsc.gov.pk" faq={faq}>
  <section>
    <h2>FPSC kya hai?</h2>
    <p>
      FPSC, yani Federal Public Service Commission, wafaqi hukumat ka idara hai jo wafaqi wizaraton aur mahkamon ki bohat si posts ke liye bharti
      karta hai. Is ke ishtihar poore mulk ke liye hote hain, lekin aksar seats soobon aur zones mein banti hoti hain. Is liye har post ke sath likha
      quota aur zone dekhna zaroori hai.
    </p>
    <p>
      Ishtihar mein post, scale, taleem, umar, tajurba aur akhri tareekh di hoti hai. Kuch posts par tajurba zaroori hota hai aur kuch par khaas
      degree.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>FPSC mein online apply kaise karein</h2>
    <p>
      FPSC ki official website par account banayen aur apni maloomat, taleem aur tajurba likhein. Phir post chun kar form bharein. Fee ka challan
      bank mein jama karein aur us ki tafseel form mein darj karein. Aakhir mein form ki copy save ya print kar lein.
    </p>
    <p>
      Documents ki tasveerein saaf hon aur naam har jagah CNIC ke mutabiq ho. Domicile aur degree ki tareekhein sahih likhein, kyun ke baad mein
      documents ki jaanch hoti hai.
    </p>
    <p>
      Apply karne se pehle yeh bhi dekh lein ke aap ka zone ya soobe ka quota us post mein maujood hai ya nahin. Agar ek se zyada posts par apply
      karna ho to har post ka alag form aur alag fee hoti hai.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Test aur interview</h2>
    <p>
      Aam taur par pehle screening ya likhit test hota hai, phir interview. Kai posts ke test mein general ability, English, current affairs aur us
      post ka professional mazmoon hota hai. Har post ka syllabus aur pattern FPSC ke ishtihar ya website par diya jata hai.
    </p>
    <p>
      Rozana thori tayyari kafi madad karti hai: <a href="/daily-test">aaj ka muft test</a> dein, <a href="/mcqs">MCQs practice</a> karein aur
      <a href="/notes">muft notes</a> parhein.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Hamari apply service</h2>
    <p>
      Job ke page par "Hum apply kar dein" dabayen aur documents WhatsApp par bhejein. Hum form bhar kar challan aur form ki copy aap ko bhej dete
      hain. Hamari fee aur sarkari fee alag alag hain. Tafseel <a href="/apply-service">apply service</a> par.
    </p>
  </section>
</OrgJobsPage>
